{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Similarity"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"simRankSimilarity","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"importanceFactor","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","text":"NoConvergence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Similarity07SimRankA0V","text":"SimRankSimilarity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","title":"simRankSimilarity(importanceFactor:tolerance:maxIterations:)","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P10SimilarityE07simRankD016importanceFactor9tolerance13maxIterationsAD03SimfD0VyxGSd_SdSitAA13NoConvergenceVYKF","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Similarity\/SimRank.swift#L244","fileName":"SimRank.swift"}},"abstract":[{"text":"SimRank (Jeh and Widom): two vertices are similar when the vertices pointing to them are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"similar.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Similarity\/documentation\/Similarity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/simRankSimilarity(importanceFactor:tolerance:maxIterations:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Similarity\/documentation\/Similarity","doc:\/\/Similarity\/documentation\/Similarity\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Similarity\/documentation\/Similarity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"simRankSimilarity","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"importanceFactor","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 0.9, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 1e-4, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 1000) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NoConvergence","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/NoConvergence","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SimRankSimilarity","identifier":"doc:\/\/Similarity\/documentation\/Similarity\/SimRankSimilarity","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Similarity07SimRankA0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"importanceFactor","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"C, the decay applied to each step away from the pair."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"tolerance","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The largest change in any similarity that counts as converged."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"maxIterations","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The most steps to take.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every pair’s similarity, symmetric, with 1 on the diagonal.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"S(A, a) = 1, and for a ≠ b, s(a, b) = C \/ (|I(a)| |I(b)|) · Σ s(i, j) over i ∈ I(a) and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"j ∈ I(b), or 0 when a or b has no in-neighbor, where I(x) is the set of predecessors of x:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parallel arcs count once, and a vertex with a self-loop is its own predecessor. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iteration starts from s(a, b) = 0 for a ≠ b and stops after the first step whose largest","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change in any similarity is below ","type":"text"},{"code":"tolerance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". O(n (n + m)) per step and O(n²) memory, for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"n vertices and m edges.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"importanceFactor"},{"type":"text","text":" is between 0 and 1, exclusive; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance"},{"type":"text","text":" is positive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and finite; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"type":"text","text":" is at least 1."}]}],"name":"Precondition"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NoConvergence"},{"text":" when no step of the first ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"text":" changes every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"similarity by less than ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance"},{"text":", with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"text":" and the last step’s largest","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Throws"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/similarity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/simranksimilarity(importancefactor:tolerance:maxiterations:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/NoConvergence":{"title":"NoConvergence","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NoConvergence","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The error an iterative method throws when it uses up its iteration limit without meeting its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stopping rule.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"NoConvergence","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/NoConvergence","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/noconvergence"},"doc://Similarity/documentation/Similarity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/simRankSimilarity(importanceFactor:tolerance:maxIterations:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"SimRank (Jeh and Widom): two vertices are similar when the vertices pointing to them are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"similar.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Similarity\/documentation\/Similarity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/simRankSimilarity(importanceFactor:tolerance:maxIterations:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"simRankSimilarity","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"importanceFactor","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},